              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cjscott"
            },
            "reviewBody": "As a former bartender who worked at a bar famous for these drinks, we used about 2 oz. vodka, 2 oz. kahlua (we pour strong) then poured in about 8 oz. half &amp; half, then topped off with the coke (about 2-3 oz) We also had customers who prefered it with vanilla flavored vodka. It's really good!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
