            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "M Stoffel"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this tonight looking to try something new, and I enjoyed it enough. Lighter than a white Russian and pleasantly fizzy. Made mine with diet Coke, which Wikipedia tells me is a Colorado Greyhound - either way, it's a little heavy on the cola. If I were to make again I'd just use a splash of cola. Thanks for sharing.",
            "datePublished": "2010-05-17T20:01:22.807Z"
          },
